olchiki-ocr
===========

This distribution ships a validated Ol Chiki (Santali) text-recognition model
and reuses third-party software, fonts, and data. This NOTICE provides the
required attributions and documents the license split between the packaging
code and the published model artifacts.


License split (Req 5.3, 5.5)
----------------------------
The PACKAGING CODE in this distribution (the `olchiki_ocr` import package and
its build/packaging files) is licensed under the MIT License. See LICENSE.

The PUBLISHED MODEL ARTIFACTS -- the trainable Base_Weights (`.pth` checkpoint)
